  "description": "The proposed work is for a single storey rear extension for a single family dwelling, expanding the existing 8.6 metre kitchen to a proposed area of 21.7 square metres.  The rear elevation is flat roof construction (with a 2-3° fall for rain to gutter) with standard London stock brick facade to match house facade.  It will be partially glazed with a single window and glazed double doors to the garden, with satin matt aluminium frames in dark grey powder coat finish.  The rear wall extends vertically to form a parapet wall with concrete coping stone.  The flat roof incorporates a glazed skylight.  (See attached plans.)",
